</footer>

</body>
</html>','Discover balbacua: the rich Filipino oxtail soup carrying centuries of history and flavor.','["balbacua","Filipino oxtail soup","Cebuano balbacua","balbacua recipe","barbacoa Philippines","Manila-Acapulco galleon trade","Filipino food history","Visayan cuisine","Mindanao food","tausi","annatto","puso","Filipino comfort food","Spanish colonial cuisine","Filipino stew"]','https://tbveujdfminxzxlsadpc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/covers/cover-1793234773041.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iVKPJnKwTVc',NULL,NULL,'{}'
