</footer>

</body>
</html>','Explore how taxes follow Filipinos from birth to death—and where the money goes.','["Philippines taxes","Republic of Tax Philippines","income tax Philippines","VAT Philippines","excise tax fuel","estate tax Philippines","OFW remittance fees","small business taxes Philippines","digital freelancer tax Philippines","sin tax Philippines","real property tax","tax transparency Philippines","government accountability","cost of living Philippines","tax burden Filipino workers"]','https://tbveujdfminxzxlsadpc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/covers/cover-1793263049164.jpg','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r4SlMj9YWxs',NULL,NULL,'{}'
