</footer>

</body>
</html>','Explore AI''s dual threat: human safety risks and massive environmental infrastructure costs.','["AI risks","AI environmental impact","AI data centers","artificial intelligence safety","AI alignment","AI energy consumption","AI water usage","AI governance","AI job displacement","deepfakes","AI climate cost","sustainable AI","AI infrastructure"]','https://tbveujdfminxzxlsadpc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/covers/cover-1793320234649.jpg','https://tbveujdfminxzxlsadpc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/videos/video-1793879313053-the-dual-challenge-of-ai-humanity-s-risks-and-environmental--video-16.mp4',NULL,NULL,'{}'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM articles WHERE title='The Dual Challenge of AI: Humanity''s Risks and Environmental Cost' AND date='2026-10-30');

