        <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="st">f"  {k}={v[:30]}..."</span>)

os_demo()</pre></div>
                        <div class="output-panel"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="note-new">✨ Prefer <code>pathlib</code> for new code — it''s more intuitive and less error‑prone. Use <code>os</code> when you need specific system calls.</div>
                </div>
