                <div class="oop-block">
                    <h3>📦 3.1 Copy, Move, and Rename</h3>
                    <p>Copy files and directories, move them, or rename them — all with <code>shutil</code>.</p>

                    <h4 style="color:var(--blue-lt);font-size:0.8rem;margin-top:0.8rem;margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Step-by-step explanation:</h4>
                    <ul class="step-list">
                        <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Import <code>shutil</code> and <code>pathlib</code>.</li>
                        <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Create a source file with some content.</li>
                        <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Use <code>shutil.copy2()</code> to copy with metadata preservation.</li>
                        <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Use <code>shutil.move()</code> to move or rename a file.</li>
                        <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Copy an entire directory tree with <code>shutil.copytree()</code>.</li>
                        <li><strong>Step 6:</strong> Clean up by removing created files and directories.</li>
