                        <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Create a sample HTML string.</li>
                        <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Parse the HTML with <code>BeautifulSoup(html, "html.parser")</code>.</li>
                        <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Use <code>soup.find()</code> and <code>soup.find_all()</code> to extract elements.</li>
                        <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Access attributes with <code>tag.get("href")</code>.</li>
