            <a class="share-btn twitter" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Why%20Filipinos%20Feel%20Left%20Behind%3A%20Wages%2C%20Commutes%2C%20and%20the%20Cost%20of%20Survival&url=https%3A%2F%2Fpoetic-codes.pages.dev%2Fphilippines-falling-behind-filipino-workers&via=PoeticGlenn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Share on X (Twitter)">
