</body>
</html>','From anito to aswang: how Filipino spirits survived colonialism and faith.','["aswang","manananggal","anito","diwata","babaylan","kapre","tikbalang","duwende","nuno sa punso","Bakunawa"]','https://tbveujdfminxzxlsadpc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/covers/cover-1793478724471.jpg','https://tbveujdfminxzxlsadpc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/videos/video-1793803684452-philippine-supernatural-belief-aswang-anito-diwata-history-video-3747-1.mp4',NULL,NULL,'{}'
