</html>','How Ilonggo migrants from Western Visayas built Mindanao''s cities, farms, and fisheries—and the costs of that frontier.','["ilonggo migration","mindanao history","general santos city","kidapawan","visayan settlers","landlessness","fishponds","zamboanga sibugay","philippine migration","ilonggo diaspora"]','https://tbveujdfminxzxlsadpc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/covers/cover-1793845687570.jpg','https://tbveujdfminxzxlsadpc.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/videos/video-1793850284867-the-ilonggo-journey-from-landless-shores-to-building-mindana-video-691893.mp4',NULL,NULL,'{}'
