                </div>
                <h1>The Origin of the Visayan People and Their Connections to the Srivijaya Empire and the Bisaya of Borneo</h1>
                <p class="lead">Hello and good day to everyone out there, welcome back, and this is another essay about the origin of the Visayan people and their connections to the Srivijaya Empire and to the Bisaya of Borneo.</p>
                <div class="hero-meta">
                    <span><i class="fas fa-user"></i> By Glenn Junsay Pansensoy (@PoeticGlenn)</span>
                    <span><i class="fas fa-calendar-alt"></i> Published Feb 10, 2026</span>
                    <span><i class="fas fa-clock"></i> 22 min read</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="toc" aria-labelledby="toc-heading" style="padding: 1.5rem 0;">
            <div class="page-col">
                <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:1rem;">
                    <h2 id="toc-heading" style="font-size:1.2rem;">📑 Table of Contents</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="toc-grid">
                    <a href="#intro">📖 Introduction</a>
                    <a href="#austronesian">🚢 Austronesian Roots</a>
                    <a href="#name-bisaya">🏷️ The Name "Bisaya"</a>
                    <a href="#borneo">🗺️ Bisaya of Borneo</a>
                    <a href="#society">🌴 Early Society</a>
                    <a href="#srivijaya">🌊 Srivijaya Empire</a>
                    <a href="#trade">⚓ Trade and Evidence</a>
